<title>ITALY: Olivetti shares suspended limit down.</title>
<headline>Olivetti shares suspended limit down.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Italy's Olivetti were suspended at the 10 percent limit down level on Wednesday at 500 lire a share following the group's release of 1996 and first quarter 1997 results and a share capital reduction plan late Tuesday.</p>
<p>Olivetti said in a statement late on Tuesday that its pretax loss in the first quarter of 1997 was around 180 billion lire, while it planned a share capital restructuring which would in effect reduce the number of shares in issue.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
